"x": 30,
"y": 76,
"width": 1500,
"height": 23,
"strokeColor": "#334155",
"text": "Two processes on your Mac. The Bolt bridge only translates between Slack and eve. The eve server does the thinking.",
"originalText": "Two processes on your Mac. The Bolt bridge only translates between Slack and eve. The eve server does the thinking.",
"fontSize": 18,
"fontFamily": 3,
